{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this sequel to the comedy/otome visual novel <i>Fetch Quest</i>, Flora gives herself a one-week deadline to raise her stats high enough to ask her crush out on a date. Is it silly and arbitrary? Yes! Will it work? Who knows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~50k word story, and ~8k words of extras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light stat-raising.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A romance story with a trans man love interest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different &quot;Date&quot; endings depending on Flora's stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An otome game within an otome game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, choose one of four games for Flora to play with her friends and level up her stats. But be careful\u2013Flora has been known to get a little <i>too</i> into her hobbies. If she doesn't strike the right balance, she might completely forget what her original goal was in the first place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Acumen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902560/extras/4b4620459ecbfb960ed60c845ce019cd.avif?t=1762869123\" width=1600 height=1079 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Flora chooses to play the 4X board game <i>Techno-opolis</i>, she'll increase her <strong>Acumen</strong> stat. This is a measure of her strategic thinking and problem-solving skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Charm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902560/extras/9dd3f88916db6922b2c4fbe410a8f1cd.avif?t=1762869123\" width=1600 height=1079 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Flora chooses to play the social deduction game <i>Of Fiends and Fangs,</i> She'll increase her <strong>Charm</strong>. This indicates her ability to control and manipulate others with the power of her words.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gud</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902560/extras/8f789997b9e8f4acfa0c13b02dcbe5c1.avif?t=1762869123\" width=1600 height=1078 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the action role-playing video game <i>Clockwork Mercenaries</i>, Flora will increase her <strong>Gud</strong> stat. This is not only a measure of her skill, but her grit and perseverance as well.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Moxie</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902560/extras/7676d6d6dee075d934f59bf63536fafb.avif?t=1762869123\" width=1600 height=1079 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Flora plays the indie ghost hunting videogame <i>Ghost Factory 2</i>, her <strong>Moxie </strong>will increase. This determines how brave she is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902560?t=1762869123","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902560?t=1762869123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902560/96b0fdc5bdc736dadc04fedefd8cfd91179499b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762869123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902560/96b0fdc5bdc736dadc04fedefd8cfd91179499b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762869123","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4037860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this sequel to the comedy/otome visual novel <i>Fetch Quest</i>, Flora gives herself a one-week deadline to raise her stats high enough to ask her crush out on a date. Is it silly and arbitrary? Yes! Will it work? Who knows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~50k word story, and ~8k words of extras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light stat-raising.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A romance story with a trans man love interest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different &quot;Date&quot; endings depending on Flora's stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An otome game within an otome game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, choose one of four games for Flora to play with her friends and level up her stats. But be careful\u2013Flora has been known to get a little <i>too</i> into her hobbies. If she doesn't strike the right balance, she might completely forget what her original goal was in the first place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Acumen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902560/extras/4b4620459ecbfb960ed60c845ce019cd.avif?t=1762869123\" width=1600 height=1079 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Flora chooses to play the 4X board game <i>Techno-opolis</i>, she'll increase her <strong>Acumen</strong> stat. This is a measure of her strategic thinking and problem-solving skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Charm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902560/extras/9dd3f88916db6922b2c4fbe410a8f1cd.avif?t=1762869123\" width=1600 height=1079 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Flora chooses to play the social deduction game <i>Of Fiends and Fangs,</i> She'll increase her <strong>Charm</strong>. This indicates her ability to control and manipulate others with the power of her words.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gud</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902560/extras/8f789997b9e8f4acfa0c13b02dcbe5c1.avif?t=1762869123\" width=1600 height=1078 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the action role-playing video game <i>Clockwork Mercenaries</i>, Flora will increase her <strong>Gud</strong> stat. This is not only a measure of her skill, but her grit and perseverance as well.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Moxie</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902560/extras/7676d6d6dee075d934f59bf63536fafb.avif?t=1762869123\" width=1600 height=1079 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Flora plays the indie ghost